  m_Name: Cards_EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructionText: Now you have to make a very difficult decision... Play your cards
    and find the best solution for everyone!
  btnConfirmLabel: Confirm Final
  btnCancelLabel: Reset
  nameYourself: Yourself Card
  nameMonster: Monster Card
  namePeople: People Card
  nameLove: Love Card
  final1Text: "I won\u2019t open the box\u2026 If I open it, the dark creature will
    die\u2026"
  final2Text: "I will open the box anyway, even if the dark creature  dies\u2026"
  final3Text: "I won\u2019t open the box because that will kill the dark creature
    ... INSTEAD, I give it the opportunity to behave or I will come back and open
    box anyway."
  final4Text: "I won\u2019t open the box because that will kill he dark creature...
    INSTEAD I will stay here in the lair to keep it at bay, be its constant guard
    so it doesn't fall back into old habits, keeping the world save\u2026"
  final5Text: "I will convince the dark creature that sometimes it's better to let
    go of what you hold most dear\u2026 I will convince it to open its heart and
    give me the box..."
